  "description": "Jin-Hyeok can't accept the sudden death of his boyfriend, Do-Seong, who passed away in a tragic accident two months ago. One night, he writes a letter to Do-Seong before falling asleep...and wakes up to find him standing right in front of him.\n\nA heartfelt and mysterious story unfolds as Jin-Hyeok tries to hold on to the love he thought he'd lost forever.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)\n\n*Note: Part of Bomtoon’s and Lezhin’s Saekgwi Danpyeonseon (색귀 단편선) Short Story Collection or Dirty Demon Collection in English.*",
